{"code":"079950","name":"인베니아","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"디스플레이장비및부품","sector_desc":"디스플레이 제조 장비와 부품·소재. 패널 업체의 설비 투자 사이클에 실적이 몰립니다.","desc":"동사는 2001년 평판 Display 제조 공정용 장비 개발 및 생산을 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2005년 코스닥시장에 상장됨. 종속회사로 인베니아(심천)과무유한공사를 보유하고 있으며, 평판 디스플레이 제조공정용 부품 제조 판매 및 용역서비스를 영위하고 있음. TFT-LCD, OLED 등 디스플레이 패널 제조 장비를 개발·생산·판매하며, Dry Etcher를 중심으로 합착기, 진공물류시스템 등으로 사업 영역을 확장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":1366.0,"open":1390.0,"high":1495.0,"low":1342.0,"volume":47152,"amount":64409632.0,"ret_1d":-1.7266,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":11.2006,"ret_5":-4.0056,"ret_20":17.354,"ret_60":6.0559,"ret_120":18.886,"ret_250":-12.3235,"ma20":1425.5,"ma60":1266.9167,"ma120":1138.0667,"ma200":1513.63,"close_vs_ma200":-9.7534,"close_vs_ma60":7.8208,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":337.1861,"r2_60":0.4065,"slope_120":137.6005,"r2_120":0.4764,"slope_250":-41.4386,"r2_250":0.1587,"high52":7440.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":18.3602,"dd_52w":-81.6398,"mdd_1y":-85.8537,"atr14_pct":7.9952,"vol_ann_60":99.0798,"vol_avg20":67391.65,"vol_ratio20":0.6997,"vr5":0.2136,"vr20":0.2516,"amount_avg5":61308595.2,"amount_avg20":96263261.6,"amount_avg60":215106001.8333,"obv_chg20":37.7504,"turnover_20":9.7675,"pv_eff_20":1.7767,"rsi14":48.3724,"frgn_net_5":-9136.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0662,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0662,"frgn_net_20":46509.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.337,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.337,"frgn_net_60":47656.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.3454,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.3454,"frgn_net_120":83901.0,"inst_net_120":-1896.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.608,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0137,"smart_net_120_pct":0.5943,"foreign_ratio":2.92,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.21,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-26.0,"op_margin_q":-100.0,"op_qoq":-1400.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-333.3333,"rev_yoy":-10.3448,"op_trend_4q":20.4878,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-34.18,"debt_ratio":147.85,"per":null,"pbr":0.84,"di